# The two image builds need only the package's own inputs: bench/Dockerfile copies
# pyproject.toml + src/, and orchestration/Dockerfile also reads uv.lock for its frozen
# install. Everything else — terraform state, the cluster manifests, docs, git, caches,
# results — stays out of the build context so it can't bloat or leak into a layer.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src
